; Current room number
;
; Number of the room Willy is in. The room data is at $C000 + 256 * number
; (#R$8912 uses the low 6 bits). Set to $21, the Bathroom, by #R$87CA; changed
; by the room exit routines (#R$948A, #R$949E, #R$94B0, #R$94D2) from the exit
; bytes of the room, and by the cheat teleport of #R$8B07 (with key 9 held, keys
; 1-5 and 6 give the number in binary: observed, 2+3 gave room 6). Also read by
; the code that depends on the room (#R$93D1, #R$9637 and others).
@label=CurrentRoom
g$8420 DEFB $00
